{
  "Verify this logo's credentials": "驗證這個標誌的憑證",
  "Trust": "信任",
  "Where content comes from, how to check it and what happens to your data.": "內容從何而來、如何查證，以及你的資料會怎樣。",
  "Our AI Stance": "我們的 AI 立場",
  "AI as labour, never as impersonation - and the machinery that enforces it.": "AI 是勞動力，絕不冒充人 - 以及落實這一點的機制。",
  "Why this differs": "為何與眾不同",
  "The frictions you have been trained to accept, and what replaces them.": "你被迫習慣的那些阻礙，以及取代它們的方案。",
  "Security": "安全性",
  "The cryptography, the threat model and the limits stated as plainly as the guarantees.": "密碼學、威脅模型，以及和保證講得一樣白的限制。",
  "Inclusive Design": "包容性設計",
  "Accessibility, language coverage and the commitments we hold ourselves to.": "無障礙、語言涵蓋範圍，以及我們對自己的承諾。",
  "Read the detail": "閱讀詳情",
  "Every format in detail": "每種格式的細節",
  "Open this one": "開啟這一個",
  "Make something, right now": "現在就動手做",
  "Three ordinary jobs. Pick one: it opens already filled in, and the words are yours to change.": "三件日常任務。挑一個：打開就已經填好，文字隨你改。",
  "**The internet is optional with Lolly: use it when it helps, never surrender control.** A font you pick, a place you look up, a link you share - things happen online only because you asked. Nothing you make ever leaves your device, and no one is listening in. Turn the Wi-Fi off and everything still works. **Freedom is sweet.**": "**網路在這裡是選項：需要時再用，永遠不必交出控制權。** 你挑的字型、你查的地點、你分享的連結，會連上網路都是因為你開口。你做的東西不會離開你的裝置，也沒有人在旁邊偷聽。關掉 Wi-Fi，一切照樣運作。**自由很甜美。**",
  "The privacy policy": "隱私權政策",
  "Verify it yourself": "自己驗證",
  "You are in control": "由你作主",
  "AI helps only when you ask, and only with the piece you point it at. Nothing is decided for you.": "AI 只在你開口時幫忙，也只處理你指定的那一塊。沒有任何事情替你決定。",
  "It stops costing": "不會一直收費",
  "If AI helps make something once, the result is yours. Using it again is free, however many times you need it.": "AI 幫你做出來一次，成果就是你的。之後再用都免費，要用幾次都行。",
  "It stays honest": "它保持誠實",
  "A piece made by AI says so, and what you make carries your name instead of pretending to be someone else. Even the built-in help works this way: ask it a question and it answers with the manual’s own sentence and a link, never a made-up answer.": "AI 做的作品會註明是 AI 做的，你做的作品掛你的名字，不會假冒別人。內建說明也一樣：你問問題，它用手冊原本的句子加上連結回答，絕不編造。",
  "AI, on your terms": "AI，照你的規矩",
  "You never need AI here. If you want it, three things are worth knowing.": "在這裡你永遠不需要 AI。如果你想用，有三件事值得知道。",
  "Where we stand on AI": "我們對 AI 的立場",
  "You did not expect an infrastructure company here. The most critical problem in everyday creative tools is where the files go, and that is the problem SUSE has worked on for more than three decades, securing IT for many of the largest enterprises in the world. We had the creative problem ourselves, so we fixed it the way we fix everything: in the open, where anyone can check the work.": "你大概沒想到會在這裡看到一家基礎架構公司。日常創意工具最要命的問題，是檔案跑到哪裡去；而這正是 SUSE 三十多年來處理的問題，為全球許多最大型企業守住 IT。我們自己也遇過這個創意上的難題，所以就用我們一貫的方式解決：公開進行，任何人都能檢查成果。",
  "Who is behind this": "這是誰做的",
  "About": "關於",
  "Free, and it stays free": "免費，而且會一直免費",
  "A version that has been released is licensed so it can never be taken back. The free Lolly always exists, whatever happens next.": "已經釋出的版本，授權讓它永遠收不回去。不管以後發生什麼，免費的 Lolly 都會一直存在。",
  "Open source": "開放原始碼",
  "Read it, run it, fork it, keep it. Nothing on this page needs to be believed: the code is public and the claims are checkable.": "讀它、執行它、分支它、留著它。這一頁不需要你相信任何事：程式碼是公開的，說法都可以查證。",
  "Blind by design": "設計上就看不見你",
  "Lolly reports nothing back. Nobody, the makers included, can see who runs it or what they make. A tool that cannot see you has nothing to sell about you.": "Lolly 不回傳任何東西。沒有人看得到誰在用、做了什麼，做它的人也一樣。看不見你的工具，沒有你的東西可賣。",
  "Your vote, visible": "你的決定，看得見",
  "Your work never goes where you have no say. Anything that touches the internet happens because you chose it, at the moment you chose it, and the code that keeps that promise is open for anyone to read.": "你的作品不會跑到你說不上話的地方。任何碰到網路的動作，都是你選了才發生、在你選的那一刻發生，而守住這個承諾的程式碼，人人都能讀。",
  "Nothing to sell you, nothing to take": "沒有東西要賣你，也沒有東西可拿",
  "Anyone with something to make": "任何想做點東西的人",
  "The everyday jobs, finished properly.": "日常的任務，好好完成。",
  "A poster for the fete, a price list for the stall, an invitation with a code that just works. You type the words; the layout, colours and type are already right.": "園遊會的海報、攤位的價目表、邀請函上的碼真的掃得動。你只要打字；版面、顏色和字體早就對了。",
  "**No account, no set-up.** Open it and start; the first file takes about a minute.": "**不用帳號，不用設定。** 打開就開始；第一個檔案大約一分鐘。",
  "**It comes out right.** The design decisions are already made, so you cannot pick the wrong font.": "**做出來就是對的。** 設計決定都已經做好，你不可能挑錯字型。",
  "**The old way was waiting for a favour or fighting a template site.** Here it is type, look, done.": "**以前不是等人幫忙，就是跟範本網站纏鬥。** 在這裡是打字、看一眼、完成。",
  "**Make three now.** [Make something in 60 seconds](/info/make-something.html) walks you through.": "**現在就做三個。**[60 秒做出一個東西](/info/make-something.html) 帶你走一遍。",
  "Also built for machines": "也為機器而生",
  "An agent fills in the same tools a person does, and the people who answer for them get the security case at technical depth.": "代理程式填的是人用的同一批工具，而要為它們負責的人，拿得到有技術深度的安全說明。",
  "Lolly is young: its cryptography and file parsing are in SUSE’s infrastructure hardening now, the discipline behind more than three decades of securing the world’s largest enterprises. Content Credentials and local encryption are strong by design, and the security has not yet been externally audited.": "Lolly 還很年輕：它的密碼學與檔案解析正在 SUSE 的基礎架構強化流程裡，那是三十多年來守護全球最大型企業的功夫。Content Credentials 與本機加密在設計上很紮實，而安全性尚未經過外部稽核。",
